PGE extension of bayesian_listener (Barumerli et al., 2026)

Apply to https://github.com/robaru/bayesian_listener at commit 7961faa
(v0.2.0) with:  git apply bayesian_listener_pge.patch

Implements the positive spectral-gradient convention ('barumerli2023pge',
a stub upstream) with gradients taken at the measured directions before
spatial interpolation, passes the convention through the two-stage fit,
avoids an overflow of I0(kappa) in the stage-1 von Mises likelihood, and adds
tests. As a modification of bayesian_listener, this patch is distributed
under the EUPL-1.2, the licence of the original work.

